flowchart TD
    A[Workflow request] --> B{Envelope valid?}
    B -- No --> X[BLOCKED]
    B -- Yes --> C[Exception triage]
    C --> D[Optional snapshot reconciliation]
    D --> E[Action governance]
    E --> F[Aggregate findings and reasons]
    F --> G{Any invalid or unknown input?}
    G -- Yes --> X
    G -- No --> H{Human review needed?}
    H -- Yes --> I[HUMAN_REVIEW_REQUIRED]
    H -- No --> J[READY_FOR_HUMAN_REVIEW]
    X --> K[Return report; no side effects]
    I --> K
    J --> K
